nows of a  bug in the oven control unit firmware  that can cause temperature patterns to  fluctuate the oven OEM rolls out an  update over the air to address the issue  to reflect that let's modify our  simulator  to see if quality improved Fatima  filters for the last 10 minutes and  refreshes the data and the quality  improvement is clearly visible this will  also drive up oee and Achieve Carlos's  objectives  well that's it for today's demo I hope  it gave you a good overview of the  virtually Limitless possibilities that  we can help unlock for our customers  [Music]


